          "message": {
            "text": "Continuous exclusion follows Chromium’s failure-bearing operation contract, not sampled evidence. Matching translate/scale parameters and exact 2D rotation-arc extrema are bounded before reverse-order composition; any path that would require decomposition, projective mapping, or an unknown timing grammar returns null so the caller retains paint. This is intentionally a smaller supported set than Chromium, with the same safe failure direction.",
            "markdown": "Continuous exclusion follows Chromium’s failure-bearing operation contract, not sampled evidence. Matching translate/scale parameters and exact 2D rotation-arc extrema are bounded before reverse-order composition; any path that would require decomposition, projective mapping, or an unknown timing grammar returns null so the caller retains paint. This is intentionally a smaller supported set than Chromium, with the same safe failure direction."
          },
